WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.140
Here’s what a forward deployed
engineer actually does.

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:07.780
They go inside an organisation
and work within the business.

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:10.920
They talk to the different teams
and the people in them

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:13.780
to understand what they need

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:18.580
and, more importantly, the problems
they actually face every day.

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:22.100
They keep refining the product

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:27.200
so the business can run
much more effectively.
